  "decision_conditions": [
    "Notwithstanding any hereby approved plans and documents, the development\nhereby permitted shall not be occupied until details of the proposed boundary\ntreatment details for the subdivision of the rear outdoor amenity space has been submitted to and\napproved in writing by the local planning authority. The development shall be\ncarried out and operated in accordance with the approved details in perpetuity,  including the provision of the outdoor amenity space itself, unless otherwise agreed in writing.",
    "Notwithstanding the hereby approved proposed plans, prior to occupation, both ground floor windows on the south facing side elevation of the property shall be updated to be :\n(a) of purpose-made obscure glass,\n(b) be permanently fixed closed below a height of 1.7m above finished floor level,\nand shall thereafter be retained in that form.",
    "The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Notwithstanding the hereby\napproved plans and documents, the development hereby permitted shall not be\noccupied until details of covered, accessible and secure cycle storage has been\nsubmitted to, and approved in writing by the local planning authority. The\ndevelopment shall be carried out in accordance with the details as so agreed,\nand the storage provision shall be in place prior to the first occupation of\nthe development, and retained thereafter.",
    "The\ndevelopment hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the\nfollowing approved plans and documents:HSH001-BA-A1-GF-DR-A-2011 - Site Location Plan;\nHSH001-BA-A1-GF-DR-A-2012 - Block Plan; HSH001-BA-A1-01-DR-A-2000 -\nExisting Basement Plan; HSH001-BA-A1-01-DR-A-2002 - Existing First Floor\nPlan; HSH001-BA-A1-01-DR-A-2002 - Existing First Floor Plan; HSH001-BA-A1-02-DR-A-2003-P02\n- Existing-Second Floor Plan; HSH001-BA-A1-01-DR-A-2004- Existing Roof Plan;\nHSH001-BA-A1-ZZ-DR-A-2005 – Existing Elevations; HSH001-BA-A1-GF-DR-A-2006-\nP02 - Proposed Ground Floor Plan (received 09.04.24); HSH001-BA-A1-01-DR-A-2007--P02\n– Proposed First Floor Plan (received 09.04.24); HSH001-BA-A1-02-DR-A-2008-P02 -\nProposed Second Floor Plan (received 09.04.24); HSH001-BA-A1-RF-DR-A-2009 -\nProposed Roof Plan; HSH001-BA-A1-ZZ-DR-A-2010 - Proposed Elevation; HSH001-BA-A1-GF-DR-A-2020\n- Amenity space (received 09.04.24) ; P23-1130 Rev A - Design and Access Statement (received 09.94.24)All\ndocuments received 13.02.24 unless\notherwise stated",
    "Notwithstanding any hereby\napproved plans and documents, prior to the\ncommencement of the development hereby permitted, a\nfull Fire Safety\nStatement shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the local planning\nauthority. The development shall be carried out and operated in accordance with\nthe approved details in perpetuity (unless otherwise agreed in writing).",
    "Notwithstanding\nany hereby approved plans, the development hereby permitted shall not be\noccupied until details of accessible, screened refuse and recycling storage\n(including relevant enclosures) has been submitted to, and approved in writing\nby the local planning authority. The development shall be carried out in\naccordance with the details as so agreed, and the storage provision shall be in\nplace prior to the first occupation of the development. The refuse and waste\nbins shall be stored at all times, other than on collection days, within the\nthereby approved designated refuse storage area"
